      3. A FINITE SPANNING FAMILY OF ACTUAL ORBIT DIRECTIONS `X_1, …, X_n` of `V`
         (`exists_spanning_family`: a linearly independent subset of the orbit directions
         spanning `V`, finite by Noetherianity, enumerated).
      4. THE PRODUCT MAP `F(t) = e^{t_1 X_1} ⋯ e^{t_n X_n}`, exactly reachable for every `t`
         (`prodMap_mem_reachable`), with strict derivative `h ↦ Σ h_j X_j` at `0`
